<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>404 — File Tidak Ditemukan</title><meta name="description" content="File yang Anda cari tidak ditemukan atau telah dihapus."><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><meta name="theme-color" content="#141218"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="https://cdn.zhyllanfyllah.my.id/cdn/privite/assets/portofolio/favicon.png"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.zhyllanfyllah.my.id" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.zhyllanfyllah.my.id/cdn/public/css/materialZ/1.0.0.css"><style>@font-face{font-family:Chillax;src:url('https://cdn.zhyllanfyllah.my.id/cdn/privite/fonts/format/woff2/Chillax-Regular.woff2') format('woff2');font-weight:400;font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Chillax;src:url('https://cdn.zhyllanfyllah.my.id/cdn/privite/fonts/format/woff2/Chillax-Semibold.woff2') format('woff2');font-weight:600;font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans';src:url('https://cdn.zhyllanfyllah.my.id/cdn/privite/fonts/format/woff2/PlusJakartaSans-Regular.woff2') format('woff2');font-weight:200 800;font-display:swap}:root{--m3-font-brand:'Chillax',system-ui,sans-serif;--m3-font-plain:'Plus Jakarta Sans',system-ui,sans-serif}*,::after,::before{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body,html{height:100%}body{font-family:var(--m3-font-plain);background:var(--m3-surface,#141218);color:var(--m3-on-surface,#e6e0e9);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh;padding:32px 24px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale}.error-wrap{text-align:center;max-width:480px;width:100%}.error-code{font-family:var(--m3-font-brand);font-size:96px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.04em;color:var(--m3-primary,#d0bcff);margin-bottom:16px;user-select:none}.error-title{font-family:var(--m3-font-brand);font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--m3-on-surface,#e6e0e9);margin-bottom:10px}.error-desc{font-family:var(--m3-font-plain);font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--m3-on-surface-variant,#cac4d0);margin-bottom:32px}.error-divider{width:64px;height:1px;background:var(--m3-outline-variant,#49454f);margin:32px auto;border:none}.error-footer{font-family:var(--m3-font-plain);font-size:12px;color:var(--m3-on-surface-variant,#cac4d0)}.error-footer a{color:var(--m3-primary,#d0bcff);text-decoration:none}.error-footer a:hover{text-decoration:underline}@media (max-width:480px){.error-code{font-size:72px}.error-title{font-size:20px}.error-desc{font-size:13px}}</style></head><body><div class="error-wrap"><div class="error-code">404</div><h1 class="error-title">File Tidak Ditemukan</h1><p class="error-desc">File yang Anda cari tidak ditemukan atau telah dihapus. Periksa kembali tautan Anda, atau kembali ke halaman utama.</p><hr class="error-divider"><footer class="error-footer">© 2025 <a href="https://zhyllanfyllah.my.id">Zhyllan Fyllah</a> — Jirankun</footer></div></body></html>